# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
title    Overworld
composer Claude
about    Old stones in the grass and the road winding on: a marimba ostinato in E Dorian that turns against the bar line, echoed by a music box, under a slow flute tune and a bassoon. When something is near the tune falls away and toms, timpani and a shaker take over; it comes back with a light kit when the thing comes for you, horn and crash join for a fight, and choir and gong for a guardian.
tempo    80
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.4

# moods (music/README.md)
# mood explore:  lead bassoon marimba echo harp strings bass
# mood treasure: marimba echo harp strings wonder
# mood sense:    marimba strings bass timpani toms shaker
# mood rise:     sense lead echo harp kick snare
# mood fight:    rise -harp -shaker horn crash
# mood boss:     fight -lead -echo choir gong

voice lead     flute     vol=0.72 pan=-0.1 rev=0.45
voice horn     horn      vol=0.75 pan=0.2  oct=-1
voice bassoon  bassoon   vol=0.45 pan=0.2
voice marimba  marimba   vol=0.6  pan=-0.45
voice echo     musicbox  vol=0.28 pan=0.5  rev=0.55
voice harp     harp      vol=0.55 pan=0.25
voice strings  strings   vol=0.28 pan=-0.2 center=A3 att=0.4 rel=0.8
voice bass     upright   vol=0.75 gate=0.85
voice wonder   celesta   vol=0.35 pan=-0.3 rev=0.6
voice choir    voices    vol=0.3  att=0.5 rel=0.8
voice timpani  timpani   vol=0.55 pan=-0.1
voice toms     tomlo     vol=0.45 pan=-0.2
voice shaker   shaker    vol=0.4  pan=0.3
voice kick     kick      vol=0.55
voice snare    snare     vol=0.42 pan=0.1
voice crash    crash     vol=0.22 pan=0.2
voice gong     gong      vol=0.3  pan=-0.3

